-8\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Answer:</strong> Yes, RPSC will release the <strong data-end=\"789\" data-start=\"743\">admit card a few days before the exam date</strong>.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Question:</strong> What details will be mentioned in the <strong>exam date notice?</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Answer: Exam schedule, reporting time, exam shift, center guidelines, and important instructions.</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Question:</strong> What is the official website for <b>RPSC</b>?</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Answer:</strong> The official website for <strong>RPSC</strong> is <strong>https://rpsc.rajasthan.gov.in/</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<p><img alt=\"RPSC Assistant Electrical Inspector Answer Key 2026\" class=\"size-full wp-image-30784 aligncenter\" decoding=\"async\" fetchpriority=\"high\" height=\"566\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" src=\"http://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/Rajasthan-RPSC-Assistant-Electrical-Inspector-Recruitment-2025.jpg\" srcset=\"https://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/Rajasthan-RPSC-Assistant-Electrical-Inspector-Recruitment-2025.jpg 1024w, https://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/Rajasthan-RPSC-Assistant-Electrical-Inspector-Recruitment-2025-300x166.jpg 300w, https://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/Rajasthan-RPSC-Assistant-Electrical-Inspector-Recruitment-2025-768x425.jpg 768w\" width=\"1024\"/></p>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-ce6e23c9\">\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-a1cd0fe1\"><span class=\"gb-headline-text\">Sarkari Result.Com.Cm</span></p>\n<p class=\"has-t